  <string name="aviso_salud_titulo">Health notice</string>
  <string name="aviso_salud">La Cucha is a food diary, not medical or nutrition advice. Goals are general estimates that don’t know your health, and food values are approximate. If you have an illness, are pregnant, or have or had an eating disorder, talk to a health professional. You use the app at your own risk.</string>
